WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.510
Lady Catarina.

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.690
You've received another gift 
from Prince Geordo.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.740
Oh... Th-Thanks.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.620
You've also received an invitation.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.780
An invitation?

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.920
Yes.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.740
An invitation to stay at the palace villa.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.410
Everyone, what shall we do?

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.700
It wouldn't do to refuse outright.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.080
But...

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.950
After <i>that</i> happened,

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.410
I'd be too embarrassed to see Geordo...

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:29.420
Catarina has zero romantic 
experience, after all!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.190
Plus, if it goes on this way, 
they're headed straight for marriage!

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.230
I don't hate Geordo or anything,

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.390
but Catarina could never hack it as royalty!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:40.310
What should we do?!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Doom</b>

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:08.580
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:08.580
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: 
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.780
<b>Episode 6 
I Had a Summer Adventure...</b>

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.900
I've been waiting for you, Catarina.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:19.550
H-Hello, Prince Geordo.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.800
We haven't had many opportunities to meet 
since summer vacation started.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:27.900
I'm so happy to see you in person like this.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.890
Thank you so much 
for the invitation, Prince Geordo.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:35.900
I had intended to spend this time 
with Catarina alone.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.260
You follow her everywhere, don't you, Keith?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.190
Well, I wouldn't want anything 
to happen to my beloved sister.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.860
She has me, her fiancé, with her.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.620
You have nothing to worry about.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:48.990
Perhaps it's time you weaned 
yourself off of your big sister?

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.460
I can't do that.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.590
Danger just inched closer 
in this very moment.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.760
And what might that mean?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.110
Lady Catarina!

00:02:58.510 --> 00:02:59.540
Everyone!

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:03.100
We heard that you would be here,

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.490
so we were waiting for you.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:08.050
We received invitations 
from Prince Alan, as well.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.550
Didn't we, Brother?

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:14.040
I'm so happy that I was invited, as well.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.530
With everyone here, 
we can keep an eye on things...

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.910
I mean, have a wonderful time together!

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:21.250
Alan...

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.720
S-Since we were doing this, 
I thought we should have the whole gang over.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.490
No taking it back now, I suppose.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.180
We have some special 
entertainment planned for tonight.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.720
Please look forward to it, Catarina.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.770
O-Okay...

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:42.240
<i>So typical of a conquerable 
character in an otome game.</i>

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.870
<i>Seeing Geordo looking at me like 
that makes my heart race.</i>

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.200
<i>It was so easy to talk to him before...</i>

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.080
<i>If I do become royalty,</i>

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.700
<i>I guess I won't be able to 
climb trees anymore...</i>

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:03.220
<i>I probably won't be allowed to 
farm or fish, either.</i>

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.470
<i>I won't be able to eat food 
I buy walking around in town.</i>

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.400
<i>I might not even be allowed to 
read romance novels.</i>

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:12.280
<i>I could never handle such a suffocating life.</i>

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.270
Lady Catarina.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.300
Maria...

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.630
I saw you wander off this way.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.040
Why have you come out here by yourself?

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.880
I just wanted a little fresh air.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:25.650
Come join me, Maria.

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:26.890
Okay.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:31.070
The shade feels so nice and cool.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.200
Doesn't it?

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:35.050
I came here when I was little, too.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:38.210
I would climb the trees 
and such. It was so fun.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.360
That sounds just like you.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:44.970
But... it makes me sad to think 
I won't be able to climb trees anymore.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.550
What do you mean?

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.310
I'd love to live like this forever,

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:52.810
but in half a year, I'll graduate 
from the magic academy.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:57.110
Then I'll have to start thinking 
seriously about marriage.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:04.090
Don't worry, Lady Catarina.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.170
Like Master Raphael said,

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.910
you can join the Department of Magic with me!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.760
Thanks, Maria...

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:14.240
But do you really think 
someone like me could get in?

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.580
There you are, Lady Catarina!

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.860
Wh-What are you doing together?!

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.960
We were just talking about some things.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.460
It's raining.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.850
Oh, I know! Everyone, this way!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.900
Whew, that was scary for a second.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:41.270
I'm glad there was a place 
where we could take shelter.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:44.600
We came in here once before, didn't we?

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.620
I remember that, too.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.620
You do remember that, huh?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.910
Sorry for talking about something 
you don't know about, Maria.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.290
Please, you don't need to apologize.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:06:00.000
I haven't heard many stories about 
when all of you were young,

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.000
so I would love to hear more.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:08.760
I think it was the first summer 
after we met Lady Catarina.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:12.570
A dinner party was being held 
at the palace villa.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.720
It's all right, Sophia.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:18.660
Okay...

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.830
I'm going to greet the princes.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.980
You can wait in our room.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.200
Very well.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.150
What a strange-looking child.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.630
I don't know who that is.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.720
I've never seen her before.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.600
My, how unpleasant.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.440
That's the cursed child 
of the Ascart family.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:36.240
Sophia!

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.330
I've been waiting for you!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.140
It's our first time sleeping over 
together! I've been so excited!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:43.940
Let's take a walk around later!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:46.250
I brought some great romance novels!

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.050
I'd love to read together, too!

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.800
Lady Catarina...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.760
Is something wrong?

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.090
No, nothing.

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:59.060
I'm just so happy I had 
the chance to see you.

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.810
I'm glad, too!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.920
Come on, let's go to our room and play!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.440
O-Okay.

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.230
Welcome, Catarina.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:11.530
We have time until dinner.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.520
Would you like to have some 
delicious sweets with me?

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:16.830
Thank you so much, Prince Geordo.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.750
You follow her everywhere, don't you, Keith?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.530
My sister and I do everything together.

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:26.040
But that will only last 
until she gets married.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.260
You should wean yourself 
off of her while you can.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:29.670
I can't do that.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.890
As her younger brother, 
it's my duty to protect her.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:36.220
Oh, no. That's <i>my</i> duty as her fiancé.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.040
Since it's so nice out,

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.930
let's all share those sweets 
and then go play outside!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.750
That's a great idea.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.270
I want to play with Lady Catarina, too.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:48.780
I heard there's a beautiful 
lake beyond the forest!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:49.990
Why don't we go there?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.360
It's best not to go into the forest.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:56.450
What? Why?

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:01.790
B-Because they say there are... 
gh-ghosts in that forest!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.120
Ghosts?!

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:07.310
Yes. According to an eyewitness,

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:09.780
they heard the sound of a woman crying,

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:12.800
and then the ghost of a
long-haired woman appeared.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.750
The ghost was just spotted last summer.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:19.900
At the time, there were plans 
to clear part of the forest.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:23.470
It was rumored that the ghost 
of a royal who loved that forest

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:28.390
was showing up out of sadness 
for its planned destruction.

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:31.040
I-I'm scared, Lady Catarina.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.990
I-It's all right, Mary.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.560
<i>I don't really like scary stuff, either.</i>

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:39.230
<i>Even in my previous life, 
I avoided manga and games that had ghosts.</i>

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:42.430
I'm disappointed we can't go 
to the lake, though.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.460
I wonder if there's a way 
to get rid of that ghost.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:45.500
Huh?!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.320
When birds mess up my fields,

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.310
I use scarecrows or loud noises 
to scare them away.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:53.130
I don't think those would work on a ghost.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.460
U-Um...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.830
What is it, Sophia?

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:59.130
Why don't we find the ghost 
and try talking to her?

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.800
Talk to the ghost?!

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:05.250
I recently read a sad story 
about a ghost and a girl.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:07.400
Ghosts were humans at one time.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.190
If we talk to her, she might agree 
to leave the forest.

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:13.280
I never thought of that! Interesting!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.110
Huh?!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:17.000
Let's all go look for that ghost together!

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.040
If we're all together, it won't be scary!

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:23.080
I-If you're going, Lady Catarina, 
I'll go with you.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.420
I-I'm going, too.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:26.500
In that case, I'll go, as well.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.020
May I go with them, Brother?

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:30.380
I'll go, too.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:33.740
D-Don't be dumb! You can't talk to ghosts!

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:37.130
What's this? Are you afraid 
of ghosts, Prince Alan?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.530
O-O-Of course not!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.950
There's no such thing as ghosts, anyway.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:44.310
Then you should come with us.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.720
F-Fine, then.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:49.310
Th-There's no such thing as ghosts!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.320
No such thing!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.520
No such thing!

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.580
Oh, how cute.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:06.210
Are you all right, Prince Alan?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.920
O-Of course I'm all right.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.780
Keith, do you want to hold hands?

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.390
Y-Yes. Thank you, Sister.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.220
I'll hold your hand, Keith.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.560
No, that's quite all right!

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.020
I don't want it, in fact!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.260
Those two get along so well.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.850
I'm scared, Lady Catarina.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.980
Then stay right beside me, okay?

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.270
Of course! I won't leave your side!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.710
Nor will I.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.470
Now there's nothing to be scared of!

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:38.490
Yes! I'm even starting to feel excited!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.450
Wh-What is it, Sister?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.950
Th-There it is!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:45.980
Huh?!

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:55.880
I caught it!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.730
A beetle!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.050
You gave me such a fright.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.310
Don't scare us like that, Sister.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.700
It's a Hercules beetle, no less!

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.970
I should have brought a bug cage.

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:13.070
You really are something, Catarina.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.790
I found one, too!

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.640
That's great, Prince Alan!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.130
It's a bit creepy here.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.730
Y-You're right.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:46.780
Maybe this is where the ghost is.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.730
Th-There's no such thing 
as ghosts! No ghosts!

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.140
You don't know that for sure.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:55.200
There might be one right behind you...

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.850
It's no use trying to scare me!

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:58.560
I'm not the least bit scared of gho—

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:07.280
No need to be afraid. It's us.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.640
Oh, it's just you.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.490
We can't allow anything 
to happen to you or Prince Alan,

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:13.880
so we followed you.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.650
So that's why! You scared me!

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:20.720
Maybe ghosts really don't exist, 
as Prince Alan says.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.220
Maybe not. There's no woman 
ghost out here, eith—

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:32.470
Lady Catarina, I followed 
you out of concern, as well.

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:35.010
Don't pop out of nowhere like that, Anne!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.980
I apologize for startling you.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.700
What's so funny, Prince Alan?

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.520
You were saying it wouldn't be scary 
if we were all together,

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.320
but you were scared out of your skin.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.780
I-I was just a little surprised!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:51.280
You were acting a lot more scared 
than me, Prince Alan!

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:52.740
W-Was not!

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:55.500
Yes, you were definitely 
more scared than me!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.140
I think they're both 
just the same, honestly.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.040
I know!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.490
Since we can't find the ghost, 
let's split into two groups to search.

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:06.080
That's a good idea, Lady Catarina!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.270
Let's divide up between 
the boys and the girls.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:09.340
Huh?

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:11.720
Are you sure you'll be all right 
without me, Sister?

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.890
I'll be fine. Anne will be with me!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.650
Will you be all right, Sophia?

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.300
Yes, Brother.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.950
I'll be with Lady Catarina, so I'll be fine.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:20.940
Okay.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:25.720
Okay, let's have a race 
to see who can find the ghost first!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:28.140
Hmph. Ghosts don't even exist,

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:30.030
but if it's a contest you want, I accept.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.250
I won't lose!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.630
I don't see that ghost anywhere.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.220
You're right.

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:41.120
Maybe it'll come out once it's nighttime...

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.260
It's raining!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:48.590
Lady Catarina, let's 
take shelter over there.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:57.270
Thank you, Anne.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.580
The weather was so nice earlier.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.440
This rain was so sudden.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:06.880
I guess we'll have to 
stay here until it stops.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.150
I do hope it stops soon.

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.700
How creepy.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:14.750
She's cursed.

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.030
What an ill omen.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.950
<i>Maybe what they all say is true.</i>

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:23.680
<i>Did it start raining so heavily 
because I'm cursed?</i>

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.900
L-Lady Catarina! That's unladylike!

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:30.760
So what? It's not as if Mother is looking.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:31.600
But still...

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.230
I'm suddenly feeling sleepy...

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.100
The thunder and lightning doesn't 
scare you, Lady Catarina?

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.460
Not really.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.340
It's not as loud as Mother 
when she's lecturing me,

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.650
and when I can watch it 
from my room, it's pretty.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.110
Also, we call this a rain of bounty.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.530
It helps the summer vegetables 
grow better when it rains like this.

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:54.900
Lady Catarina, it's so 
much fun being with you

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:57.040
that nothing scares me anymore!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.460
Even the sound of the rain 
is starting to sound like music.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.790
Music? That's wonderful!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:03.920
I just remembered!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:07.780
I've been practicing dancing 
for tonight's dinner party.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.680
Would you care to dance with me?

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.640
Yes, I'd love to!

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.500
I think you've gotten a lot better at this.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:23.550
To be a proper lady, 
one must be proficient at dancing.

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.740
That's why I practice every day.

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:27.120
That's impressive.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:29.540
You're such a hard worker, Mary.

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.090
Thank you!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.320
I'll be sure to work even harder!

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:37.980
Come dance with us, Sophia!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.790
But...

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:40.910
Come on!

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.800
You're good at this, too.

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.760
It's all right, Sophia.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.230
O-Okay...

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:07.750
Lady Sophia, you should 
try imagining something fun.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.610
It will chase the fear away.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.730
Something fun?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.040
This lightning is 
the work of an evil dragon!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:26.720
And one intrepid youth 
is fighting to defeat that dragon!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:27.680
Huh?

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:31.210
<i>I feel like that's scarier 
than the lightning...</i>

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:55.530
I'll help you!

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:11.340
The hero and the witch work together 
to defeat the dragon!

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:15.050
Then the two of them are happily married.

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:21.980
When I think about it that way, 
the lightning doesn't scare me!

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.360
You have an amazing imagination, Sophia!

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:27.850
You really do! 
Tell us the rest of the story!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.910
Sister! We've been looking for you!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.290
Keith?

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.490
Are you all right, Sophia?

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.830
Yes! I had a very fun time!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.330
Fun?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.080
Are all of you okay?

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:52.990
Yes. We returned to the mansion once,

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:55.370
but Alan was worried about you.

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:58.760
I figured the lightning 
and ghosts were freaking you out.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.890
Thank you very much 
for your concern, Prince Alan.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:02.890
H-Hmph!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.640
You went looking for a ghost? 
That sounds like fun.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.970
Looking back on it now, 
it seems so childish,

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:10.640
but it was a lot of fun.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.110
And did you find the ghost?

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.490
No, we didn't find it that time.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:18.910
That time?

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.870
It showed up later that evening.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:23.120
What?!

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:26.590
Even now, it terrifies me to think about it.

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:30.670
It happened after the dinner party...

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.620
Catarina is late.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.330
I wonder if something happened.

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:40.570
She's the one who said she wanted to 
go look for the ghost again at night.

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.840
I bet she got too scared 
to even leave her room.

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.800
Everyone, I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.250
My sister will be unable to attend.

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.010
But why?

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.430
Well...

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.360
Did you hear that?

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.750
Y-Yes! It's a girl crying!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:04.040
Y-You can't be serious!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.500
It came from outside.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:15.960
What's that?!

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:20.250
I-I-It's...

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.240
a ghost!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:26.060
I heard everything, Catarina.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.190
Catarina!

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:32.730
You took the princes out 
to climb trees again, didn't you?!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:36.280
I do not recall having raised a monkey!

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:42.170
I-I'm sorry, Mother!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:45.660
The ghost was spotted last summer, right?

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:46.500
That's right.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:51.120
It was also last summer when my sister 
was invited here for the first time.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:54.090
Which means the ghost is actually...

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:56.290
Catarina and Duchess Claes.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.520
Are you a monkey disguised as Catarina?!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:02.270
If you are, then go back 
to the mountains at once!

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:04.180
That's what happened.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:07.220
Mother was definitely 
a lot scarier than a ghost.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.930
I see.

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:13.470
Anyway, I was afraid 
of lightning when I was little,

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:15.440
but it doesn't bother me at all now.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:19.780
And this little forest 
seemed so big back then.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.940
A lot of things change 
when you grow up, huh?

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.580
Oh, the sun's come out.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:29.180
The others must be worried. 
Let's head back now.

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:31.830
You're right. But first...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.590
Since you're with us now, Maria, 
I wanted to make memories with you, too.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.440
Thank you so much, Lady Catarina!

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:44.300
This place looks just 
the same as it did back then.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.010
Yeah!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:52.360
They all look yummy!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.370
I hear you went to the forest again today.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.040
Why didn't you ask me to go with you?

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:57.260
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:59.340
There just wasn't a good time to ask you.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:01.430
Well, next time, invite me.

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:04.730
I'm the only one who can climb 
trees with you, after all.

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.570
Very well, Prince Alan.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.610
Catarina.

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:08.840
Master Nicol?

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.070
Sophia is having a great time,

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:13.420
thanks to you. I'm truly grateful.

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:17.000
Not at all! I'm having 
a wonderful time myself!

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:26.070
Catarina truly looks best 
when she's smiling.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:28.880
I do agree with you there.

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:39.200
So the special entertainment 
you had planned was fireworks?

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:40.360
Yes.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.650
Though I had intended 
to watch them alone with you...

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.860
But we'll do that another time.

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:33.200
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:40.040
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:48.420
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:55.390
<b>Secret Catarina</b>
